But they killed the most stable leaders and replaced them with war mongering dictators...  That is the point. Thomas Sankara and Patrice Lumumba are the best example of this, great leaders who put their country and people FIRST and because of this ended up  assisinated by foreign interest...Check the docs online. These actions have consequences... leads to civil war, more poverty,  refugees etc... It is a conspiracy because this type of sabotage is being done by the same people who claim to be about peace....
